# Immutable migration baseline. Once a release ships, an entry never changes
# and is never removed; a fix is a new, higher-numbered migration. Every
# migration here has an entry, appended in the change that adds it with
# `sha256sum --text NNNN_name.sql >> checksums.sha256`. Boot refuses a
# migration whose content no longer matches its entry.
